ve ground; H4 / Class 1 hardwood where close to ground or persistently wet [S]"}, {"label": "Structural grade", "value": "As specified by plans or engineering"}, {"label": "BAL", "value": "See the bushfire checklist \u2014 AS 3959 changes what the frame can be made from"}]'::jsonb)
